            "MISA investment registration",
            "Commercial registration, articles of association and activities drafted around the regulated activity",
            "ZATCA, GOSI and Qiwa registrations, coordinated with your accountants and HR provider",
            "A hiring and Saudization plan that fits Nitaqat and your regulator's expectations",
